{"seq":2,"slug":"mathematics","title":"高三数学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/mathematics","introMarkdown":"# 高三数学 简介\n\n高三数学以高考为导向，对高中三年的全部数学知识进行系统性的回顾、整合和提升。这一年的核心任务不是学习新知识，而是将分散在各个模块中的数学方法融会贯通，形成完整的解题思维体系，并在限时条件下达到准确高效的解题状态。数学是高考中区分度最大的科目，扎实的复习备考直接决定最终成绩。\n\n本知识库面向高三年级学生，适合已完成高中数学全部课程、进入系统复习阶段的学习者。全书共分三章，覆盖高考数学的三大核心复习方向。\n\n第一章**函数与分析综合复习**系统梳理函数的性质、三角函数、数列和导数等分析类知识，强化函数图像分析、参数讨论和综合应用的解题能力，重点突破导数压轴题的常见题型和方法。第二章**几何综合复习**覆盖平面几何、立体几何和解析几何三大板块，系统训练空间想象能力和代数运算能力，重点突破立体几何证明和解析几何计算这两大考试难点。第三章**备考策略与应试技巧**讲解高考数学的题型分布、分值结构和时间分配策略，分析选择题和填空题的快速解法、大题的规范书写和分步得分技巧，帮助学生在考场上最大化发挥水平。\n\n推荐函数和几何两大板块同步推进，交替复习避免疲劳。备考策略应从高三上学期就开始实践，通过反复模考积累考场经验。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"function-review","title":"函数与分析综合复习","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/mathematics/function-review","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"elementary-functions","title":"高三数学 — 基本初等函数","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/mathematics/function-review/elementary-functions"},{"seq":2,"slug":"derivative-applications","title":"高三数学 — 导数应用综合","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/mathematics/function-review/derivative-applications"},{"seq":3,"slug":"inequality-proof","title":"高三数学 — 不等式与证明","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/mathematics/function-review/inequality-proof"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"geometry-review","title":"几何综合复习","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/mathematics/geometry-review","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"solid-geometry","title":"高三数学 — 立体几何","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/mathematics/geometry-review/solid-geometry"},{"seq":2,"slug":"analytic-geometry-review","title":"高三数学 — 解析几何综合","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/mathematics/geometry-review/analytic-geometry-review"},{"seq":3,"slug":"vector-applications","title":"高三数学 — 向量应用","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/mathematics/geometry-review/vector-applications"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"exam-strategies","title":"备考策略与应试技巧","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/mathematics/exam-strategies","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"multiple-choice-tactics","title":"高三数学 — 选择填空策略","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/mathematics/exam-strategies/multiple-choice-tactics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"problem-solving-methods","title":"高三数学 — 解题方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/mathematics/exam-strategies/problem-solving-methods"},{"seq":3,"slug":"time-management","title":"高三数学 — 考场时间分配","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/mathematics/exam-strategies/time-management"}]}]}